md.append('Rule (fixed before training): identical grid at every resolution (width {0.5, 1.0, 1.5} x stem_stride {1, 2} x LR {1e-3, 3.33e-4}); candidates whose peak NPU buffer exceeds 32,768 B are logged and not trained; winner = highest seed-42 validation mIoU, ties within 0.01 -> fewer MACs.\n')
